    # uppercase-second-third, lowercase-fourth-fifth-sixth lock
    # ("fEMale"), the lowercase-first / uppercase-second-third,
    # lowercase-fourth-fifth, uppercase-sixth lock ("fEMalE"), the
    # lowercase-first / uppercase-second-third, lowercase-fourth,
    # uppercase-fifth-sixth lock ("fEMaLE"), the
    # lowercase-first / uppercase-second-third-fourth-fifth,
    # lowercase-sixth lock ("fEMALe"), the lowercase-first-two
    # uppercase-third-fourth-fifth, lowercase-sixth lock ("feMALe"),
    # the lowercase-first-two uppercase-rest lock ("feMALE"),
    # the lowercase-first-three uppercase-fourth-fifth-sixth lock
