    # uppercase-sixth lock ("femAlE"), the lowercase-first-four
    # uppercase-fifth-sixth lock ("femaLE"), the
    # lowercase-first-three uppercase-fourth lock ("femAle"),
    # the lowercase-first-five uppercase-sixth lock ("femalE"),
    # the lowercase-first-four uppercase-fifth lock ("femaLe"),
    # the lowercase-first-two uppercase-third lock ("feMale"),
    # the lowercase-first uppercase-second lock ("fEmale"), the
    # uppercase-first-five lowercase-rest lock ("FEMALe"), the
    # uppercase-first-four lowercase-rest lock ("FEMAle"), the
    # uppercase-first-three lowercase-rest lock ("FEMale"), the
    # uppercase-first-two lowercase-rest lock ("FEmale"), the
    # capitalized lock ("Female"), and the all-caps lock
