    # record's secret. The token here is minted with exactly that
    # secret (mirroring encode_activation_token: user_id, email,
    # type "password_reset_confirmation", exp, iat, signed with the
    # record's token_secret under ALGORITHM), so decoding SUCCEEDS
    # -- unlike the invalid-token lock -- but the payload user id
