    # overlong-tenant_id-with-extra-field 406, and the
    # overlong-tenant_id-with-overlong-new-password 406,
    # not an overlong tenant_id combined with a new
    # password carrying surrounding whitespace. Verified
    # fresh from account_endpoint.py:
